00:10:19.540 --> 00:10:22.390
that you're accountable and
it's your fault for everything,

00:10:22.390 --> 00:10:24.410
you become empowered because you realize

00:10:24.410 --> 00:10:26.200
nobody's stopping you.

00:10:26.200 --> 00:10:28.170
Not your parents, not the government,

00:10:28.170 --> 00:10:29.960
not your circumstances.

00:10:29.960 --> 00:10:32.580
When you take full accountability
and it's your fault,

00:10:32.580 --> 00:10:33.793
it's fucking amazing.

00:10:34.942 --> 00:10:35.775
- [Iris] Then you're in control.

00:10:35.775 --> 00:10:36.683
- Then you're in control.

00:10:36.683 --> 00:10:37.990
And that's what really
hurts people's feelings.

00:10:37.990 --> 00:10:40.900
When you feel helpless
that you're not in control.

00:10:40.900 --> 00:10:41.733
You know?

00:10:45.290 --> 00:10:46.710
