00:11:11.428 --> 00:11:14.650
And I help actually
producers, music producers,

00:11:14.650 --> 00:11:15.810
build Spotify playlists.

00:11:15.810 --> 00:11:16.643
- Okay.

00:11:16.643 --> 00:11:18.148
